WEBVTT

video-title-preparation
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Shiri

equipment
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Kana buƙatar gauze, auduga, kwali, fensir, kofi, tef da almakashi.

video-title-eye-pad
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Yin audugar rufe ido

cotton
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Don audugar rufe ido, shimfiɗa ƙwallon auduga ya zama mai siffar ƙwai, faɗinsa santimita biyar zuwa shida.

gauze
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Nannaɗe gauze a kan audugar.

pad-tape
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Liƙa tef a buɗaɗɗen ƙarshen.

trim
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Yanke gefunan gauze su bi siffar audugar.

finished-pad
00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.000
Audugar ido kenan.

video-title-eye-shield
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Yin garkuwar ido

cardboard
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Don garkuwar ido, samo kwali mai tsabta. Za a iya sake amfani da marufin kayan lafiya.

draw
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Yi amfani da kofi a matsayin samfuri, ka zana da'ira mai faɗin santimita takwas.

cut
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Yanke da'irar.

slit
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:47.000
Sannan ka yanka daga gefen zuwa tsakiyar.

cone
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Lanƙwasa kwali ya zama mazubi, ka ɗaure shi da tef.

finished-shield
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Wannan ita ce garkuwar ido.
